; Windows export file for standalone UNO component DLLs.
; No LIBRARY line: shared by every stoc reflection/introspection component DLL.
; Only the two ALWAYS-present component exports — component_canUnload is
; optional (several stoc components, e.g. introspection, don't define it;
; exporting it then fails to link).  Omitting it merely means "not unloadable".
EXPORTS
    component_getImplementationEnvironment
    component_getFactory
